  Description: |-
    The Full Body Trigger - T Pose Pacakge allows you to trigger different screen effects with custom body gestures. This asset use T Pose as an example to trigger the lighting effects attached to the user's body tracking and a post effect. Find the Object Tracking - Dance preview to preview the effect.
    
    Learn more from https://docs.snap.com/lens-studio/essential-skills/ar-tracking/body/body-templates/full-body-triggers
